 four points, faces Scranton Mayor Paige Cognetti in a race most analysts rate a tossup, though several call it a Democratic flip opportunity. No recent independent public polling is available, so the picture rests on fundamentals and expert judgment.\n\nCognetti has outraised expectations and holds a cash-on-hand lead, while Giffords PAC has invested heavily in ads attacking Bresnahan over stock trading and Medicaid votes. Prediction markets give Cognetti roughly a two-in-three chance of winning. The race remains close enough that debates, advertising, and turnout in Luzerne and Lackawanna counties will likely decide it.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.5916, "margin": 1.42}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6449, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.6453, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6734, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.617, "margin": 2.4}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.6201, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.6673, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.6811, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.6435, "margin": 2.2}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.6763, "margin": 2.5}]}